    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n126 Corn Mill is a stunning two bedroom, top floor apartment, with beautiful high ceilings that comes to market in turnkey condition throughout. This superb apartment has everything a buyer could look for including two double bedrooms, two bathrooms, two balconies, an energy efficient B BER rating, and two designated secure underground parking spaces.\n \nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with a large storage closet, an open plan, light-filled kitchen / dining / living room which opens out onto the sunny west facing balcony. There are two large double bedrooms both with fitted wardrobes. The main bedroom features an ensuite and has access to a second balcony with exceptional views to the East. An additional family bathroom completes this fine home.\n \nThe property benefits from two designated underground car parking spaces set behind secure electronic gates.\n \nThe location of Corn Mill is simply superb. The vibrant centres of Drumcondra and Fairview are located within a gentle stroll and offer a wonderful range of eateries, bars, boutiques, and shops. The property benefits from easy access to the city centre, the IFSC and Eastpoint Business Park. The M50, M1 and Dublin Airport are also easily accessible. There are multiple city and national bus links available close by, as well as train stations in both Drumcondra and Clontarf. Numerous schools and educational institutions are located nearby, including St Patrick's Training College and DCU, and the apartment also affords easy access to both the Mater and Beaumont Hospitals. This is the perfect opportunity for a discerning purchaser looking for a central, peaceful, and secure home that benefits from a wide variety of amenities on its doorstep."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nWith laminate flooring and recessed lighting.\n\nKitchen - \nLaid with tiled flooring and splashback, fitted kitchen units along with an integrated oven and hob.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - \nWell-proportioned room with recessed lighting and access to a private west facing balcony.\n\nBedroom One - \nDouble bedroom with build-in wardrobes, direct access to another private balcony and the added benefit of an ensuite.\n\nEnsuite - \nWith tiled flooring, WC, Wash Hand Basin and shower.\n\nBedroom Two - \nWith recessed lighting and built-in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - \nFully tiled bathroom comprising of a WC, Wash Hand Basin, bath and shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Top-floor, dual-aspect layout with turn-key finish</li><li>B-rated BER (qualifies for green mortgage rates)</li><li>Two large private balconies</li><li>Two designated secure underground parking spaces</li><li>Intercom and lift access</li><li>Communal gardens and spectacular roof terrace</li><li>Excellent location close to abundance of amenities</li><li>Short drive to M50, M1 and Dublin Airport</li><li>Management fee 2,000p/a approx.</ul>"
      },
